МП

A circular official stamp from the company "ФАДИБЫ" (Nuvepuba). The outer ring contains text: "ОБЩЕСТВО С ОГРАНИЧЕННОЙ ОТВЕТСТВЕННОСТЬЮ «ФАДИБЫ»", "ИНН 003856901751", and "г. Челябинск". The center of the stamp features the company name in Russian "«ФАДИБЫ»" and English "NUVEPUBA". Below this, it says "№ 1" and "МОНГОЛЬСКИЙ ПЛИТЧИТЕЛЬ". A handwritten signature is written over the top right portion of the stamp.
